### Sample Request

```bash
curl --location 'https://api.nextbillion.io/fleetify/document_templates?key=<your_api_key>' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
  "name": "sample_template",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "multi_choices",
      "label": "Package Type",
      "required": true,
      "meta": {
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Food",
            "value": "Food"
          },
          {
            "label": "Electronics",
            "value": "Electronics"
