```javascript
locations = {
  id: 12,
  description: 'GeoTab Test',
  location: location
};
```

### Step 7: Define Optimization Options

Set up the optimization options, including the objective and routing mode.

```javascript
let options = {
  objective: {
		travel_cost: "duration",
			custom: {
				type: "min",
				value: "vehicles"
			}
		},
  routing: {
    mode: "car"
  }
};
```

```javascript
